Bugfix: Raise the border contrast of the navigation rename field

The field for renaming an entry in the app navigation was bounded by a light
grey border at 1.73:1 against its surroundings. As the field and the
navigation behind it are both white, that border was the only thing marking
the control, and it was barely visible.

The border now reaches 4.05:1, the same value the other input fields use.

WCAG 2.1 AA, SC 1.4.11
